1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,000
On starlit Acropolis rock, ancient Athens begins its long remembering in stone.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:14,000
At the Propylaea gate, each arriving step carries the echo of worshippers.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:21,000
On Athena Nike’s bastion, victory takes wing above the city’s restless centuries.

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:28,500
Beside the Erechtheion Caryatids, patient stone figures bear the weight of memory.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,500
Then dawn touches the Parthenon, and the marble of Pericles becomes a living chronicle.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Below, the Odeon gathers empty seats around voices that outlive their audiences.

7
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:52,000
As sunrise climbs the peristyle, the sacred hill reveals its many lives at once.

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:59,200
By radiant day, Athens carries every vanished world forward beneath the same blue heavens.
